      "stimulus_text": "Watashino gakkou wa hiroi desu. Sankai arimasu. Kouchoushitsu, shoukuinshitsu, hokenshitsu, jimushitsu wa ikkai ni arimasu.\n\nKyoushitsu to toshoushitsu wa nikai to sankai ni arimasu. Watashi wa yasumi jikan no toki ni yoku toshoshitsu ni imasu.",
